{"scene_id": "s02141", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02141.fountain", "heading": "EXT. HOT-AIR BALLOON - OVER THE TANEZROUFT DESERT - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "PILOT MAREN COLE", "names": ["PILOT MAREN COLE", "MAREN"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 17}, {"id": 1, "name": "BOY", "names": ["BOY"], "gender": "f", "first": 7, "spoke": 9}, {"id": 2, "name": "AMADI", "names": ["AMADI"], "gender": "?", "first": 33, "spoke": 4}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "EXT. HOT-AIR BALLOON - OVER THE TANEZROUFT DESERT - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "The envelope is half-collapsed, patched with a dozen mismatched swatches of canvas.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "The wicker basket drags a shadow across a sea of red dunes that goes on to every horizon.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "No road.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "No river.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A wind that tastes of iron.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "PILOT MAREN COLE, 50s, leather helmet pushed back, sun-cracked lips, sits against the burner and rations water with a bottle cap.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Opposite her, a BOY, 12, thin as a pole in a man's flight jacket, stares at the horizon without blinking.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Drink.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You first.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I had mine.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You didn't.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then drink half and give me the rest.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "The Boy sips.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Hands her the bottle.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "She does not drink, just holds it.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What's your name?", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Maren.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not going to call you that.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You can call me whatever you like. What do I call you?", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nothing yet.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's a bad name.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "The balloon dips, then lifts again.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "The burner coughs.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Maren jams a boot against the gas line and it steadies.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Propane's low. Forty minutes of flame, maybe less.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then what?", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we go where the wind sends us.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that far?", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No farther than we've come.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "The Boy shifts.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "A silver chain slides from his collar.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "A small tin medal on the end.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Engraved: AMADI.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's your name.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's my brother's name.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where's your brother?", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "In the plane.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Maren looks at the dunes.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "A long way off, a thin black thread of smoke rises, flattens, wavers in the heat.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Amadi.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "The Boy looks at her.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's a good name. Two syllables. Easy to shout.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why not?", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "When you shout, somebody doesn't come.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Maren says nothing.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "She puts the bottle in his hands.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Drink the rest, Amadi.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "He drinks.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "She watches the smoke.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "The burner flames sputter, and for the first time a thin wind catches the envelope and turns the basket, very slowly, toward the thread of black.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Maren.", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that where we are going?", "name": "AMADI", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That is where the wind is going.", "name": "MAREN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "The flame dies.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "The basket swings.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "The desert slides under them like a tide.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}]}